hat would they have done and what  would they have had at their disposable  how would they have done it so we did as  many practical effects in as we could we  built actual sets for everything like  those are all real sets you know  everything you see in there and and our  our visual effects supervisor Joe  Farrell did an incredible job of just  sort of like taking care of the  everything else that we needed but there  weren't like blue screens and green  screens and there weren't like uh sticks  with tennis balls saying hey that's a  monster look at that there was none of  that we had the monster on set you know  we had all of this stuff there was there  for reference and even if we enhanced it  later to some degree it was still on set  for us and that was important I wanted  the actors to feel like they were in a  true environment as opposed to having  not only the work of creating these  characters for us to to to to experience  on film but then they would have to also  imagine what was around them I didn't  want any of that I just wanted them to  be there with everything so all they had  to do was just be the character you got  away with a lot more blood and guts than  I expected I was very surprised and do  you think that happened because you were  shooting it in black and white  I think that helped us it certainly  didn't hurt us uh I think that you know  uh doing something like this  we were able to push a little further  into that direction that we might have  if he had done it any other way you know  um I think people will still be  surprised when they see it you know the  people who are just like turning it on  and say you know but hey that's part of  the fun of it right I I I I felt like  you know as long as it didn't become  sadistic that was our that was our thing  like because I I'm very squeamish  generally I don't like slasher movies  for that reason uh so I didn't wanted to  ever get into that realm where it's just  indiscriminate uh killing everything  needed to have a reason and and and a  why and a how and all of that uh so I do  think that being in black and white  helped us with a lot of that you know  keeping it in that in that realm on that  note I already got to stop I'm just  gonna say congrats and I know people are  gonna love it thank you so much thank  you I'm so glad we'll talk more for sure  have a great day all right talk to you  soon
 

